					<![CDATA[
						 <p>The newest version of the S &amp; C Plastics hub is now available on the PTR. Hopefully, this is now far less confusing to read, easier to navigate, and gives a better idea as to the tone of the canon. I wrote the hub over four years ago, and it did not age well at all.</p> <p>In any case, it's here now, and Halloween will be upon us soon. And Halloween in Sloth's Pit can often get interesting. Just be sure to not go near the old fair grounds by the edge of town. And avoid the scarecrows.</p> 
				 	]]>
