				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-627637/s-c-plastics-hub#post-1835702</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Mon, 19 Aug 2013 04:30:24 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>McKinteer</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1378303</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Haven's pretty much that except the weird shit's all supernatural and the only government official in the town is the FBI agent protagonist who's not really an FBI agent but thought she was until the actual FBI agent whose identity she apparently stole shows up.</p> <p>I'm not entirely sure about all the details because I more or less quit SyFy around the time the show really started going, but the show premise is that every 20 years or so, people in the town start gaining weird and sometimes nightmarish abilities that would be worthy of SCP status.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-627637#post-1835553</guid>
