						 <p>So, these nexus things, does one of them happen to encompass the entirety of <a href="http://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/OnlyInFlorida">Florida</a>?</p> <p>Also, this setting reminds me a lot of SyFy's &quot;Eureka&quot; and &quot;Haven&quot;.</p> 
				 	]]>
